        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "e3ed9768-77b1-5f54-b264-c915988b23d4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Million Dollar Arm, The Wild, No Escape\n- People: Craig Gillespie, Thomas McCarthy, Steve \"Spaz\" Williams, Ed Decter, John J. Strauss, Mark Gibson, Philip Halprin, Lake Bell, Owen Wilson, Pierce Brosnan\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures\n- Topics: film roles, film premises\n\nFacts:\n- The Wild is a 2006 American 3D computer-animated comedy film directed by Steve \"Spaz\" Williams and written by Ed Decter, John J. Strauss, Mark Gibson, and Philip Halprin.\n- Lake Bell starred in the television series Boston Legal from 2004 to 2006 and Surface from 2005 to 2006.\n- Lake Bell appeared in the films Over Her Dead Body and What Happens in Vegas in 2008.\n- Lake Bell starred in Childrens Hospital from 2008 to 2016, It\u0019s Complicated in 2009, How to Make It in America from 2010 to 2011, and No Strings Attached in 2011.\n- Million Dollar Arm is a 2014 American biographical sports drama film directed by Craig Gillespie, produced by Walt Disney Pictures, and written by Thomas McCarthy.\n- Lake Bell appeared in Million Dollar Arm in 2014 and voiced a role in The Secret Life of Pets in 2016.\n- No Escape is a 2015 film starring Owen Wilson, Lake Bell, and Pierce Brosnan.\n- No Escape follows an expat engineer who is trapped with his family in an unnamed Southeast Asian country during a violent uprising.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "2fe2962c-8db8-54ad-8717-4b5b55b22e08",
        "text": "Page: Million Dollar Arm. Sentence: Million Dollar Arm is a 2014 American biographical sports drama film directed by Craig Gillespie and produced by Walt Disney Pictures from a screenplay written by Thomas McCarthy.\nPage: The Wild. Sentence: The Wild is a 2006 American 3D computer animated comedy directed by animator Steve \"Spaz\" Williams, and written by Ed Decter, John J. Strauss, Mark Gibson and Philip Halprin.\nPage: Lake Bell. Sentence: She has starred in various television series, including \"Boston Legal\" (2004–2006), \"Surface\" (2005–2006), \"How to Make It in America\" (2010–2011) and \"Childrens Hospital\" (2008–2016), and in films including \"Over Her Dead Body\" (2008), \"What Happens in Vegas\" (2008), \"It's Complicated\" (2009), \"No Strings Attached\" (2011), \"Million Dollar Arm\" (2014) and \"The Secret Life of Pets\" (2016).\nPage: No Escape (2015 film). Sentence: The film stars Owen Wilson, Lake Bell, and Pierce Brosnan, and tells the story of an expat engineer trapped with his family in an unnamed South-East Asian country during a violent uprising.",
